"D&D Settings": "D&D 設定",
"Setting": "設定",
"Dark Sun": "黑暗太陽",
"Heroes make their mark on a post-apocalyptic world defiled by magic and forsaken by the gods.": "英雄在一個被魔法玷汙、遭神祇遺棄的末日後世界留下足跡。",
"The forces of good battle the evil queen of dragons and her armies in the world-shaking War of the Lance.": "在撼動世界的長槍之戰中，善良勢力對抗邪惡的龍后與她的大軍。",
"In the aftermath of a deadly war, magically advanced nations rebuild as a cold war threatens lasting peace.": "一場慘烈戰爭過後，魔法發達的諸國展開重建，而一場冷戰威脅著得來不易的和平。",
"Heroes make names for themselves in the world made popular by the streaming show Critical Role.": "英雄在因網路節目《Critical Role》而走紅的世界中闖出名號。",
"Forgotten Realms": "被遺忘國度",
"Larger-than-life heroes and villains struggle to determine the fate of the world as they explore the ruins and dungeons of fallen kingdoms and long-forgotten empires.": "傳奇般的英雄與反派在探索沒落王國與遭遺忘帝國的遺跡和地下城時，爭奪世界的命運。",
"As tensions rise among warring nations, heroes plunder dungeons to gain the magic and might they need to defeat the growing forces of evil.": "交戰諸國之間的緊張日益升高，英雄深入地下城搜刮，取得擊敗日漸壯大的邪惡勢力所需的魔法與力量。",
"Sigil, the City of Doors, is where heroes begin to explore the wonders of the D&D multiverse and its many planes of existence.": "英雄從眾門之城印記城出發，探索 D&D 多元宇宙及其眾多存在位面的奇景。",
"Heroes are drawn into the gloomy Domains of Dread—cursed realms ruled by evil lords—and must find a means of escape.": "英雄被捲入陰鬱的可怖之域——由邪惡領主統治的受詛咒國度——必須設法逃脫。",
"In a world-spanning city, ten disparate factions draw heroes into a web of adventure and danger.": "在一座覆蓋整個世界的城市中，十個截然不同的派系將英雄捲入冒險與危險交織的網中。",
"Travel among the stars on a spelljamming ship, and visit worlds floating in the majestic oceans of Wildspace.": "搭乘魔法飛船在星辰間旅行，造訪漂浮在壯麗蠻荒星域之洋中的諸世界。",
"Strixhaven, a school of magic, serves as a hub of learning and adventure.": "魔法學院斯翠海文是學習與冒險的中心。",
"Heroic destinies wait to be fulfilled in this setting inspired by the myths of ancient Greece.": "在這個取材自古希臘神話的設定中，英雄的命運等待實現。",
"*This setting is based on a Magic: The Gathering world.": "*此設定取材自《魔法風雲會》的世界。",
"Adventure Connections": "冒險銜接",
"Adventure Connection": "冒險銜接",
"Introduce a person, an object, or information that the characters need to transport safely to a location involved in the new adventure.": "引入一個人物、物件或情報，角色必須將其安全送到新冒險中的某個地點。",
"Have a major villain flee to a location that features in the new adventure. The characters might be able to pursue the villain, or they might have to search for clues about where the villain has gone.": "讓一名主要反派逃往新冒險中的地點。角色可能可以直接追擊，也可能得尋找反派下落的線索。",
"Introduce clues suggesting that a villain or another NPC in this adventure is part of a larger group—a group that features prominently in the new adventure.": "引入線索，暗示本次冒險中的反派或其他 NPC 隸屬於一個更大的組織，而這個組織在新冒險中舉足輕重。",
"Introduce a villainous group that's featured in the new adventure by having its agents spy on or interfere with the characters' activities.": "讓新冒險中的邪惡組織派手下監視或干擾角色的行動，藉此引入該組織。",
"Have travelers bring news of events transpiring elsewhere, leading characters toward the new adventure.": "讓旅人帶來其他地方發生的事件消息，引導角色前往新冒險。",
"Give the characters a treasure that's wrapped in mystery they'll need to unravel in the new adventure.": "給角色一件充滿謎團的寶物，謎底要在新冒險中揭曉。",
